%% Reconstructed from PROJECT_SPEC.md receiving transaction and exported sequence labels.
sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as React
    participant API as Express
    participant Redis
    participant Service as Receiving service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    UI->>API: POST receipt with cookie, CSRF and Idempotency-Key
    API->>Redis: Check rate limit and load session
    Redis-->>API: Session and limiter result
    API->>DB: Read current user and authVersion
    DB-->>API: Current authorization data
    API->>API: Validate authentication, CSRF, role and payload
    Note over API,Redis: Dependency failure returns 503; no in-memory fallback
    API->>Service: Receive validated items
    Service->>Service: Normalize UUIDs, sort items, hash receiving + actor + payload
    Service->>DB: BEGIN READ COMMITTED; lock receiving
    Service->>DB: Find receipt by receiving and key
    DB-->>Service: Original receipt and payload hash, if any
    alt Matching receipt exists
        Service->>DB: End transaction without writes
        Service-->>API: Original immutable receipt
        API-->>UI: 200 replay; Idempotency-Replayed true
    else Key conflicts
        Service->>DB: ROLLBACK
        Service-->>API: Idempotency conflict
        API-->>UI: 409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT
    else New receipt
        Service->>DB: Reject completed; lock items; validate remaining
        alt Invalid operation
            Service->>DB: ROLLBACK
            Service-->>API: Business error
            API-->>UI: Error without stock changes
        else Valid operation
            Service->>DB: Insert receipt; update item quantities; insert ledger
            Service->>DB: Increment balances in productId order; update status
            Service->>DB: COMMIT
            Service-->>API: New immutable receipt
            API-->>UI: 201 created; Idempotency-Replayed false
        end
    end
    Note over UI,DB: Database write failure rolls back every change
    Note over UI,API: Lost response after commit: retain key + payload and replay
    UI->>UI: Invalidate affected TanStack queries after confirmed receipt
